<p>Britain said it will work with allies in the Joint Expeditionary Force to close UK waters, including the English Channel, to vessels it considers sanctioned, and it has prepared options to interdict, board, and detain ships it considers part of a Russian “shadow fleet”. Downing Street, as cited by RT, said the plan is meant to force operators either to take longer routes or risk detention by British forces. Russia called the move hostile and said it would answer with political, legal, and “asymmetric” measures to defend its interests. Moscow denied operating a shadow fleet, while the Russian Embassy in London called the proposed seizures “acts of piracy” and said the announcement came amid an escalation of Ukrainian attacks on Russian energy infrastructure.</p><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Boarding scenarios: British military and legal specialists recently prepared scenarios for vessels that do not surrender, are armed, or use advanced surveillance to avoid capture, according to Downing Street as quoted by RT.</li><li>Decision chain: RT reported that, for each potential seizure, British specialists would review the case and recommend a course of action to ministers before any detention decision.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>UK government: Downing Street framed the plan as a coordinated effort with Joint Expeditionary Force allies to keep sanctioned vessels out of UK waters and raise operating costs for targeted ship operators. (<a href='https://www.rt.com/russia/636325-russia-slams-uk-tanker-seizure-plan/'>RT</a>)</li><li>Russian Embassy in London: The embassy called Britain’s decision a hostile step and said Moscow would respond with political, legal, and asymmetric measures to protect Russian interests. (<a href='https://www.reuters.com/world/uk/russia-says-britains-decision-detain-its-vessels-is-hostile-vows-response-2026-03-26/'>Reuters</a>)</li><li>Moscow: Russian officials rejected the claim that Russia operates a shadow fleet and described seizures of vessels on the high seas as piracy. (<a href='https://www.rt.com/russia/636325-russia-slams-uk-tanker-seizure-plan/'>RT</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/russia/636325-russia-slams-uk-tanker-seizure-plan/'>Moscow slams UK plan to seize tankers suspected of carrying Russian oil</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/russia-says-britains-decision-to-detain-its-vessels-is-hostile-vows-response'>Russia says Britain&#x27;s decision to detain its vessels is hostile, vows response</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reuters.com/world/uk/russia-says-britains-decision-detain-its-vessels-is-hostile-vows-response-2026-03-26/'>Russia says the United Kingdom&#x27;s decision to board and detain shadow fleet vessels is hostile and vows a &quot;political, legal and asymmetric&quot; response against the UK to protect Russian interests.</a> - reuters.com</li></ul>